{
  "info": {
    "name": "Iraq Doctors — Patient Mobile API",
    "description": "كل endpoints تطبيق المريض (Flutter) تحت `/api/v1`.\n\n**قبل الاختبار:**\n```bash\nphp artisan migrate --force\nphp artisan db:seed\nphp artisan serve\n```\n\n**حساب تجريبي (بعد db:seed):**\n- هاتف: `07708888000`\n- كلمة المرور: `password123`\n\n**الترتيب المقترح:**\n1. Login (Patient) → يحفظ `token`\n2. Search Doctors / Laboratories / Pharmacies → يحفظ IDs\n3. Pharmacy Medicines → يحفظ `medicine_id` و `pharmacy_medicine_id`\n4. إنشاء طلبات + قبول عرض السعر + التقييمات\n\n**ملاحظات:**\n- تفاصيل الطلب (`GET .../orders/{id}`) تُرجع `timeline` و `can_accept_quote`\n- الإشعارات تُرجع `actions` (موافقة/رفض) عند عرض السعر\n- `confirm` و `complete` للمواعيد خاصة بالدكتور (داشبورد) — غير مضمنة هنا",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "doctor_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "schedule_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "branch_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "appointment_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "laboratory_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "laboratory_order_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "test_item_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pharmacy_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pharmacy_order_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pharmacy_medicine_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "medicine_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "record_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notification_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🚀 البداية السريعة",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Patient) — يحفظ token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "    pm.test('Token saved', () => pm.expect(json.data.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"07708888000\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Doctors — يحفظ doctor_id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const list = json.data || [];",
                  "  if (list.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('doctor_id', String(list[0].id));",
                  "    if (list[0].primary_branch) {",
                  "      pm.collectionVariables.set('branch_id', String(list[0].primary_branch.id));",
                  "    }",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/doctors?page=1&limit=10"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Laboratories — يحفظ laboratory_id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const list = json.data || [];",
                  "  if (list.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('laboratory_id', String(list[0].id));",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/laboratories?page=1&limit=10"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Laboratory Tests — يحفظ test_item_id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const list = json.data || [];",
                  "  if (list.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('test_item_id', String(list[0].id));",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/laboratories/{{laboratory_id}}/tests"
